/E (In summary, FedEx's selection of the ULD optimization problem stems from its potential to streamline logistics operations, reduce operational costs, and enhance customer satisfaction. By improving space utilization, increasing efficiency, and ensuring timely deliveries, the optimization of ULD packing offers significant advantages for both the company and its customers.)
