140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Many ULDs have tapered or rounded edges on one of their sides in order to enable full utilization of space inside the aircraft. For the purposes of this problem statement, assume that all available ULDs are cuboidal in shape. The packages, which are smaller in comparison to the ULDs, also come in various shapes and sizes. )
/E (Many ULDs have tapered or rounded edges on one of their sides in order to enable full utilization of space inside the aircraft. For the purposes of this problem statement, assume that all available ULDs are cuboidal in shape. The packages, which are smaller in comparison to the ULDs, also come in various shapes and sizes. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
