/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In this competition we are assuming that a package inside a ULD will be aligned along its axes. This assumption makes it easy to represent the position of a package inside a ULD by means of coordinates \(three dimensional\) of its two diagonally opposite corners. In this convention we follow two rules:)
/E (In this competition we are assuming that a package inside a ULD will be aligned along its axes. This assumption makes it easy to represent the position of a package inside a ULD by means of coordinates \(three dimensional\) of its two diagonally opposite corners. In this convention we follow two rules:)
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
